\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Decidable}(S)\n\\leftrightarrow\nS\\subseteq\\mathbb N\n\\land\\exists\\chi_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\chi_S:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_1(\\chi_S)\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\chi_S(x)=1\\leftrightarrow x\\in S)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dec}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Dec}(S)\\)</span> abbreviates <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decidable}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Decidable}(S)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>值域和全定义域现已直接写进函数类型；不再仅靠两个双条件间接推出。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-computable-function","status":"resolved","id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-computable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-computable-function","status":"resolved","id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Comp}(\\chi_S)$ (computability predicate, see [[88-df-computable-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Decidable}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}(\\chi_S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Decidable}(S)\n\\leftrightarrow\nS\\subseteq\\mathbb N\n\\land\\exists\\chi_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\chi_S:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_1(\\chi_S)\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\chi_S(x)=1\\leftrightarrow x\\in S)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dec}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Decidable}(S)","display":false